{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"阿摩司書","commonName":"阿摩司書","title":"阿摩司書","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"5606ff53dbf6d121dcf5f38beb3bd015c6c14b0f2915d7372d34815a7afdda23","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["勸以色列人悔改"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列家啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽我為你們唱哀歌：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「少女以色列跌倒了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也站不起來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她被遺棄在自己的土地上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人扶她起來。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為主耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「以色列家的城邑中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"出兵一千的，只有百人生還；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"出兵一百的，只有十人生還。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"耶和華對以色列家說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你們要尋求我，才能存活。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要去伯特利求問，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要進入吉甲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不要前往別示巴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為吉甲人必被擄去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伯特利也必化為烏有。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要尋求耶和華，才能存活。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"否則，祂要在約瑟家","poem":1},{"noteId":3},{"text":"如烈火爆發，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞噬伯特利，無人能撲滅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們這些使正義變為苦艾、將公義丟棄在地的人啊，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那位造昴星和參星、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使幽暗變為黎明、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使白晝變為黑夜、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"召來海水澆在大地上的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的名字是耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使毀滅如閃電臨到強者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摧毀他們的堅城。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"你們憎恨在城門口主持公道的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"厭惡說話正直的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們踐踏窮人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對他們橫徵暴斂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，你們用鑿過的石頭建房，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻不得居住在裡面；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們栽種佳美的葡萄園，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻喝不到葡萄酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我知道你們的過犯累累、罪惡無數。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們迫害義人，收受賄賂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在城門口冤枉窮人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是邪惡的時代，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以明智者靜默不言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要棄惡從善，才能存活。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣，萬軍之上帝耶和華必與你們同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正如你們所說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要恨惡邪惡，喜愛良善，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在城門口伸張正義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也許萬軍之上帝耶和華會恩待約瑟的餘民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"因此，主——萬軍之上帝耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「哀號之聲要響遍各廣場，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哭喊之聲將充滿大街小巷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"農夫被叫來哭泣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哭喪者被召來哀號。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每個葡萄園都傳出哀號聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我要從你們中間經過。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"盼望耶和華的日子到來的人有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們為什麼盼望耶和華的日子呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那日將帶來黑暗，而非光明。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的光景將好像人逃避獅子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻遇上了熊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"逃回家裡，手扶牆壁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又被蛇咬。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的日子將充滿黑暗，毫無光明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一片漆黑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毫無亮光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"「我憎惡、鄙棄你們的節期，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"厭惡你們的聖會。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使你們獻上燔祭和素祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不悅納；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使你們用肥美的牲畜獻上平安祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不屑一顧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"消除你們嘈雜的歌聲吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不想聽到你們的琴音。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯願公正如江河滔滔不盡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公義如溪流綿綿不絕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列家啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在曠野的四十年間，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們向我獻過祭物和供物嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們抬著為自己造的神像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是你們的王撒固和星神迦溫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我要把你們流放到比大馬士革還遠的地方。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的，祂的名字是萬軍之上帝。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"「約瑟家」此處指約瑟的子孫以法蓮和瑪拿西兩個支派，聖經中有時用約瑟家代指北國以色列。","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":27}